{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And it shall belong to Aaron and to his sons</b> — this meal-offering, for anything that comes from grain is included in the category of minhah. <b>And they shall eat it</b> — [the masculine singular suffix -hu] refers back to the bread; this is the language of Rashi (Rashi on Leviticus 24:9). And it is possible that 'and it shall belong' [refers] to each one of the arrangements [of bread]. And by way of truth, 'and it shall belong to Aaron and to his sons [as] an everlasting covenant,' in the manner of 'My covenant was with him, [the covenant of] life and peace' (Malachi 2:5)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:59:02.149871063Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}